"\n"
"*to accept*, visit the [moderators page for %(url)s](%(url)s/about/moderators) and click \"accept\".\n"
"\n"
"*otherwise,* if you did not expect to receive this, you can simply ignore this invitation or report it.\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"*Before accepting, we encourage you to review our [Moderator Guidelines](/help/moderatorguidelines) to understand the expectations and responsibilities of being a moderator.*"
msgstr ""
"**ostres! t'han convidat a ser moderador de [%(title)s](%(url)s)!**\n"
"\n"
"*per acceptar*, visita la [pàgina de moderadors de %(url)s](%(url)s/about/moderators) i fes clic a «accepta».\n"
"\n"
"*si no*, si no esperaves rebre això, pots simplement ignorar aquesta invitació o denunciar-la.\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"*Abans d'acceptar, et recomanem que llegeixis les nostres [Directrius per a moderadors](/help/moderatorguidelines) per entendre les expectatives i responsabilitats de ser moderador.*"

